    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100 (4C/8T, 3.6 GHz base, up to 4.3 GHz boost)  AMD Ryzen 3 3100 (4C/8T, 3.6 GHz base, up to 3.9 GHz boost)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 or AMD Radeon RX 590<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Notes: CPU (Processor) \u2022 At least 4 physical cores \u2022 Base Clock: ~2.4\u20133.0 GHz \u2022 Boost Clock: ~3.5\u20134.0 GHz \u2022 Intel Examples (modern 4C/8T or stronger):     - Intel Core i3-10100 (4C/8T, 3.6 GHz base, up to 4.3 GHz boost)     - Intel Core i5-7500 (4C/4T, 3.4 GHz base, up to 3.8 GHz boost) [older, but closer to Deck than i5-6400] \u2022 AMD Examples (4C/8T or stronger):     - AMD Ryzen 3 3100 (4C/8T, 3.6 GHz base, up to 3.9 GHz boost)     - AMD Ryzen 5 1400 (4C/8T, 3.2 GHz base, up to 3.4 GHz boost) [older Zen1, but has 8 threads] GPU (Graphics Card) \u2022 NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650   or AMD Radeon RX 590 Memory (RAM) \u2022 Minimum: 6 GB Storage \u2022 20 GB of available HDD space (SSD strongly recommended)</li></ul>",
